    caiso_dsw_lateevening_clean: { cell: ".", ev: "caiso-269 (2026-09-10) new-mechanism emission under rule 24 [R-MECH-MATRIX] duty (c) — a PR adding a solve-affecting mechanism adds its base row plus a cell line in EVERY shard. Classification (a) ISO-EXCLUSIVE ELSEWHERE: the row names CAISO's own market object (ScenarioConfig.caiso_dsw_lateevening_clean, the south-corridor WECC_DSW clean-import depth on the hod 22-23 window), a foreign caiso_ stem, and no non-owner ISO has entered this cell at HEAD, so there is no SPP object to arm. NOT A VERDICT and no SPP evidence is claimed: SPP has no keeper and no solve at HEAD. A later lane that identifies an SPP seam-import analogue re-opens it as U and derives its own parameters from SPP's own market data (rule 25 [R-ISO-SCOPE]: the CAISO K verdict transfers to no other ISO)." },
