    egrid_family_heat_rates: { cell: "U", ev: "SPP-21 (2026-09-06) shard seed, no verdict minted (docs/multi-iso/spp-addition-plan-2026-09.md §4 W5 queue / §5 row SPP-21) — U: UNTESTED. SPP has no keeper, no solve and no measurement on this mechanism; rules 25 [R-ISO-SCOPE] / 28(d) mean no other ISO's verdict fills this cell. The lever queue is docs/mechanism-testing-matrix.md §5.7. SPP-46 (2026-09-07, zero LP): NAMED as the on-registry repair for SPP's mixed-plant heat rates — keeper-3 prices every unit of a plant at the eGRID plant blend (Northeastern 2963: coal 460 + CC 444 + ST 434 MW on one row at 12.24, the CC never runs, -1.1 / -1.5 TWh in 2024 / 2025; Earl F Wisdom 1217 CT at 19.36). Still U: no SPP artifact (derive_egrid_family_heat_rates.py --iso SPP not run). ROUTED SPP-46 R-3." },
